hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1210","Muhammad ibn Bashar narrated to us, Muhammad and Abd al-Rahman narrated to us, Shu’bah narrated to us, on the authority of Ali, who was Ibn Ata’, that he heard Ali al-Azdi He heard Ibn Umar narrating: On the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said: “The night and day prayers are two by two.” Muhammad ibn al-Walid narrated to us, Muhammad ibn Ja`far narrated to us, Shu`bah narrated to us, on the authority of Ali ibn Ata, on the authority of Ali al-Azdi, on the authority of Ibn Umar On the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, similarly"
